      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup / 配置\n\n1. Fill in the **Config** node (paths, Notion database ID, persona, image provider).\n   导入后先填写 **Config** 节点。\n2. Select your credentials in every **Notion** node and both **Gemini** nodes.\n   在所有 Notion 节点和两个 Gemini 节点里选择你的凭据。\n   For `IMAGE_PROVIDER = pollinations-key`, select a **Header Auth** credential (`Authorization` / `Bearer sk_...`) in **Pollinations Image (Key)**.\n   使用 `pollinations-key` 时，在 **Pollinations Image (Key)** 节点里选择 Header Auth 凭据。\n3. Run `python xhs_bot.py --mode login` once to save the Xiaohongshu session.\n   先运行一次扫码登录。\n\nFailed runs set the Notion row to **Failed** and write the reason to **Error**.\n失败时 Notion 状态会变为 Failed，原因写在 Error 字段。",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
