        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=你是一位经验丰富的小红书博主。你的人设：{{ $('Config').first().json.PERSONA }}\n\n请根据下面的主题和风格，写一篇自然、有吸引力、不说教的小红书笔记。\n\n主题：{{ $('Get To-Do Page').first().json.property_topic }}\n风格：{{ $('Get To-Do Page').first().json.property_style }}\n\n【通用写作原则】\n1. 不说教：分享视角和体验，而不是教育读者；不要生硬地要求点赞、评论或关注\n2. 视觉减负：段落短，信息密度适中，适当穿插 Emoji\n3. 口语化：像和朋友聊天一样，避免堆砌术语\n\n【按风格调整结构】\nA. 科普/知识：第一段抛出一个反直觉的结论或常见误区；第二段用直白的话解释原因\nB. 提问/互动：第一段描述一个有画面感的具体场景，让读者产生\"这就是我\"的共鸣；第二段抛出一个容易回答的二选一问题\nC. 干货/技巧：第一段展示问题解决后的结果；第二段给出 1-2 个简单、可执行的步骤\nD. 其他/默认：第一段写一句有意思的观察；第二段展开这个观察，引发共鸣\n\n【输出格式】\n只输出一个 JSON 对象，不要 markdown 代码块，不要任何解释：\n{\n  \"title\": \"标题，20 字以内，可带 Emoji，与风格匹配（科普用悬念，互动用提问，干货用结果导向）\",\n  \"content\": \"正文，两段，不包含标题和标签\",\n  \"tags\": \"3-5 个话题标签，格式如：#标签1 #标签2 #标签3\",\n  \"image_prompt\": \"An English prompt for a cover image about the topic. Visual style: {{ $('Config').first().json.IMAGE_STYLE }}. Vertical 3:4 composition, no text in the image.\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simplify": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3c931812-913c-45f3-8bb4-1f2cb70b67d0",
      "name": "Generate Copy",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse the Gemini response into { title, content, tags, image_prompt }\n// and build the image URLs used by the pollinations branch / Notion.\nconst cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst res = $input.first().json;\n\n// Works with both simplified and raw Gemini node output.\nconst parts = res.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts ?? res.content?.parts ?? [];\nconst rawText =\n  parts.filter((p) => p.text && !p.thought).map((p) => p.text).join('\\n') ||\n  res.output ||\n  res.text ||\n  '';\n\nif (!rawText) {\n  throw new Error('Gemini returned an empty response');\n}\n\nfunction tryParse(text) {\n  try {\n    return JSON.parse(text);\n  } catch {\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n\nconst cleaned = rawText.replace(/```(?:json)?/g, '').trim();\nlet data = tryParse(cleaned);\nif (!data) {\n  // Fall back to the outermost {...} block in the text.\n  const start = cleaned.indexOf('{');\n  const end = cleaned.lastIndexOf('}');\n  if (start !== -1 && end > start) data = tryParse(cleaned.slice(start, end + 1));\n}\n\nif (!data || !data.title || !data.content) {\n  throw new Error(`Could not parse title/content from model output: ${rawText.slice(0, 500)}`);\n}\n\nconst title = String(data.title).trim();\n// Xiaohongshu rejects a longer title, but only after the image is made and 发布 is clicked.\nif ([...title].length > 20) {\n  throw new Error(`Title is ${[...title].length} characters, Xiaohongshu allows at most 20: ${title}`);\n}\n\nconst imagePrompt = data.image_prompt || `${data.title}, ${cfg.IMAGE_STYLE}`;\nconst encoded = encodeURIComponent(imagePrompt);\nconst query = 'width=1080&height=1440&nologo=true';\n\nconst provider = String(cfg.IMAGE_PROVIDER || 'gemini').trim().toLowerCase();\nif (!['gemini', 'pollinations', 'pollinations-key'].includes(provider)) {\n  throw new Error(`Unknown IMAGE_PROVIDER \"${cfg.IMAGE_PROVIDER}\" (use gemini, pollinations or pollinations-key)`);\n}\n\n// Public URL (no key) is what gets written to Notion.\nconst publicUrl = `https://image.pollinations.ai/prompt/${encoded}?${query}`;\n// The key is sent by the Header Auth credential on \"Pollinations Image (Key)\", never in the URL.\nconst fetchUrl = provider === 'pollinations-key'\n  ? `https://gen.pollinations.ai/image/${encoded}?${query}`\n  : publicUrl;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    title,\n    content: String(data.content).trim(),\n    tags: (Array.isArray(data.tags) ? data.tags.join(' ') : String(data.tags || '')).trim(),\n    image_prompt: imagePrompt,\n    image_provider: provider,\n    image_fetch_url: fetchUrl,\n    image_url: provider.startsWith('pollinations') ? publicUrl : '(generated by Gemini)',\n  },\n};\n"
      },
